sequenceDiagram
  participant H as History consumer
  participant K as Kafka transaction coordinator
  participant S as Source topic / consumer offset
  participant D as DLQ topic
  H->>S: poll invalid event at coordinate
  H->>K: begin transaction
  H->>D: send poison with source headers
  H->>K: stage source offset
  alt crash before commit
    H--xK: process halts; transaction aborts
    Note over S: source offset remains unchanged
    Note over D: aborted write stays hidden to read_committed
    H->>S: restart and redeliver
    H->>K: commit DLQ record and source offset atomically
  else commit then crash
    H->>K: commit DLQ and offset atomically
    H--xK: process halts before next poll
    Note over S,D: record and offset are both durable
  end
